OL,3,GNEWSASchools close early for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teachers had warned parents that
OL,7,Flarge crowds were expected to gather at
OL,8,FSt John The Evangelist Church for the
OL,9,Ffuneral, with traffic disruption
OL,10,Flikely.
